"For bookings created by mistake. Sessions with payment or refund records must be kept. Deleting a package session restores its credit and leaves package payments unchanged." = "用于删除误建的预约。有关联收付款记录的课程需保留。删除课包课程会释放对应课时，课包收付款保持不变。";
"This permanently removes this session and its notes, releases any package credit and removes its reminder. Other sessions in a recurring booking are kept." = "将永久删除这节课程及其备注，释放对应课包课时，并移除课前提醒。重复预约中的其他课程会保留。";
"A copy was added to Calendar. Delete that event separately in your calendar app." = "这节课程曾添加到日历，请在日历 App 中另行删除该日程。";

"Sessions complete automatically after their end time when the app is open or reopened. You can change the status anytime. Used and booked sessions both reserve package credits. A past session you manually set to Scheduled stays scheduled." = "课程结束后会自动标记完成；App 关闭期间结束的课程，会在重新打开时更新。你可随时修改状态。已使用和已预约的课程均占用课包课时。手动改为“已预约”的过期课程会保持该状态。";
"Sessions complete automatically after their end time when the app is open or reopened. You can change the status anytime. Single sessions never use package credits or automatically record payments. A past session you manually set to Scheduled stays scheduled." = "课程结束后会自动标记完成；App 关闭期间结束的课程，会在重新打开时更新。你可随时修改状态。单次课不占用课包课时，也不会自动记录收款。手动改为“已预约”的过期课程会保持该状态。";

"Each booking reserves 1 package credit and reduces credits left. After the session ends, booked becomes used without deducting a second credit." = "每次预约占用 1 个课包课时，剩余课时随之减少。课程结束后，由“已预约”转为“已使用”，不会重复扣减。";
